      "body": "Hi! I've got confused using FNO for complex data.\nI want to map real data to complex field, so I set FNO parameter \"complex_data\" to True.\nWhen I try to train a model it I got an error \"imag is not implemented for tensors with non-complex dtypes\".\nIf I deliberately change the input dtype from \"float32\" to \"complex64\" the error is the same.\nPlease, explain, how to process complex data correctly.\n\nUpd.\nI use PTDataset to load data and as far as I understand the code the \"x\" vector is deliberately converted to \"float32\" (not \"y\" vector though).\nShould I use smth else to load my data?\n",
