      "body": "Hi, i am trying to reproduce your exepriments result.\r\nI just change the TRAIN_PATH and TEST_PATH to '/home/data/NavierStokes_V1e-5_N1200_T20.mat' \r\nand change T from 40 to 10, and then run:\r\n` python3.7 fourier_3d.py`\r\nThe result that i got as follow, maybe some thing wrong, \r\n\r\nPlease take a look, thanks,\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n489 10.252128057181835 0.019634807519614696 0.08073463827371598 0.22321295380592346\r\n490 8.146521881921217 0.019635397335514428 0.08073771142959595 0.2236676424741745\r\n491 10.866600763052702 0.019629415897652505 0.08073480159044266 0.2232614892721176\r\n492 8.50566947995685 0.019635313227772712 0.08075259721279145 0.22349709749221802\r\n493 10.444014868000522 0.019620819902047514 0.08072293162345887 0.2237038666009903\r\n494 12.948399811983109 0.019610148882493378 0.08068822592496872 0.2233934336900711\r\n495 8.396875259000808 0.019591552671045065 0.08063761121034622 0.22345163762569428\r\n496 8.427478078054264 0.019569343607872724 0.08057864302396775 0.22329660773277282\r\n497 10.278667164035141 0.01957395510748029 0.08059006589651108 0.22355687558650972\r\n498 8.890411228872836 0.01956247627735138 0.0805699879527092 0.22378367960453033\r\n499 8.894694186048582 0.019547253418713807 0.0805325716137886 0.2240159559249878\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"fourier_3d.py\", line 303, in <module>\r\n    out = y_normalizer.decode(out)\r\n  File \"/home/zongyi/fourier_neural_operator/utilities3.py\", line 99, in decode\r\n    x = (x * std) + mean\r\nRuntimeError: The size of tensor a (10) must match the size of tensor b (64) at non-singleton dimension 3\r\n```",
